{"id":"palo","lemma":"palo","pos":"noun","rank":2066,"glosses":["stake, stick, wood","suit","hit, blow, strike (especially, with a stick)"],"ipa":"/ˈpalo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"palos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/72/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-palo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Revuelve la pintura con un palo.","en":"Stir the paint with a stick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804015","words":[{"g":"to stir, to mix","l":"revolver"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"painting"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"El perro estaba olfateando un palo.","en":"The dog was sniffing a stick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706577","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"dog"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Los niños tienen palos que brillan.","en":"The children have glow sticks.","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"child, boy","l":"niño"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to shine","l":"brillar"}]},{"text":"Mira aquel palo en la plaza.","en":"Look at that pole in the square.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706619","words":[{"g":"target"},{"g":"that (over there"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"plaza, town square"}]},{"text":"¿Dónde compraste tus palos de golf?","en":"Where did you buy your golf clubs?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611903","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to buy","l":"comprar"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"golf"}]}]}